/-
  LeanAID.Proofs.Tests — oref0's class A and B unit tests as theorems (M6).
  GENERATED by scripts/gen_test_theorems.js. Do not edit.

  For each test: `<id>_test` states the test's own assertions about oref0's
  inputs and is proved by kernel evaluation; `<id>_general`, when present, is the
  general theorem the test is an instance of, applied to the same input.
  Regex assertions on `reason` are checked as "these literal pieces occur in
  order" (each `.*` of the regex separates pieces; a literal `.` is required).
-/
import LeanAID.Proofs.Lifted
import LeanAID.Proofs.ValidCheck
